# reproducible or runtime data, never committed: fixtures re-fetch from their SOURCES.md lines, state is runtime, organism seeds are emitted by genome/emit.mjs
bench/fixtures/*
# ...except the one fixture the daemon opens at boot (bench/answer.mjs buildQuestions): it is authored
# here, no SOURCES.md line can re-fetch it, and without it a clean checkout (the GitHub Actions host,
# .github/workflows/cloud.yml) restarts the daemon until the wall ends (checkout trial at 64a3ac1:
# built false, 6 restarts in 90 s; with this file: built true, 0 restarts). Board 16 builder, host item.
!bench/fixtures/answer-questions.json
state/
# work/ is the generation working directory (briefs, candidates, verdicts): runtime like state/, but readable by the arms
work/
organism/*
!organism/gen-0-pruned/
!organism/gen-1-4-4-1-4/
